"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F279409741923107_122257921460281105+-+We+all+want+to+keep+our+families%2C+our+schools%2C+and+our+communities+safe+from+gun+violence%2C+which+has+become+the+number+one+cause+of+death+for+children+and+teens+in+the+U.S.I%E2%80%99m+proud+that+Moms+Demand+Action+for+Gun+Sense+in+America%2C+a+grassroots+movement+of+Americans+fighting+for+public+safety+measures+that+can+protect+people+from+gun+violence%2C+has+awarded+me+the+2026+Moms+Demand+Action+Gun+Sense+Candidate+distinction.+I+support+and+advocate+for+common+sense+gun+safety+laws+that+not+only+protect+innocent+lives+but+also+protect+responsible+gun+owners.+Having+grown+up+in+a+family+that+put+food+on+the+table%2C+in+part%2C+through+lawful+hunting%2C+I+understand+the+importance+of+using+guns+to+provide+for+one%E2%80%99s+family+and+the+cultural+importance+of+hunting.+Communities+can+have+both+responsible+gun+ownership+and+safety+for+all%2C+but+we+need+to+work+across+party+lines+to+close+loopholes+and+make+it+happen+%E2%80%93+which+I+am+willing+to+do.Gun+deaths+across+NYS+Assembly+District+121+%282021-2025%29%3ABroome%3A+54+lives+lostChenango%3A+26+lives+lostDelaware%3A+26+lives+lostMadison%3A+30+lives+lostOtsego%3A+28+lives+lostThat%E2%80%99s+164+lives+too+many%2C+and+15+more+lives+lost+in+a+five-year+period+%282018-2022%29+than+the+last+time+I+ran+for+Assembly+in+2024.+No+one+law+can+stop+all+tragedies%2C+but+there+are+critical%2C+commonsense+steps+%E2%80%94+with+strong+bipartisan+support+%E2%80%94+we+can+take+now+to+keep+guns+out+of+dangerous+hands.++Delaware+County+NY+Democrats+Otsego+County+Democrats+Broome+County+Democratic+Party+Madison+County+NY+Democratic+Committee+Chenango+County+Democrats+Binghamton+City+Democratic+Committee+Town+of+Sidney+NY+Democratic+Committee++Democratic+Women+of+Broome+County+Hamilton+Democratic+Committee"
},
